  "final_message": "Subscription billing console is complete and verified.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): SQLite schema in `./data`, bearer-token auth (register 201 / login 200 / 401 unauth), subscriptions CRUD with `q`/`status`/`plan`/`page`/`page_size` paging (newest first), invoices (issue open, default amount = monthly), collection runs (`failed` increments `failed_payment_count`, flips active\u2192past_due; `succeeded` marks open invoices paid, resets count), public `mrr` (active + past_due only) + per-status `counts`, JSON errors, SPA static serving with API-path 404s.\n\n**Frontend**: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind v4 (via `@tailwindcss/vite`) + react-router. Pages: public overview (MRR + status counts), register/login with sign-out header, subscription list (status tabs, plan filter, debounced customer search, paging), detail (edit form, invoice history, issue invoice, collection buttons), new subscription. `tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build` both clean.\n\n**Verified**: 24/24 end-to-end API checks pass over gunicorn (exact Docker CMD), `npm ci` + `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` both succeed from lock files, static/deep-link serving works, and `./data/app.db` persists across server restarts. Test artifacts cleaned up.",
  "final_message_truncated": false,
